{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25443","headline":"思山居一十首 忆村中老人春酒 · 李德裕","name":"思山居一十首 忆村中老人春酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二叟茅茨下，清晨饮浊醪。\n雨残红芍药，风落紫樱桃。\n巢燕衔泥疾，檐虫挂网高。\n闲思春谷事，转觉宦途劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}